<title>JAPAN: Nippon Pipe -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Pipe -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.92		vs	   12.11</p>
<p> Operating	  445    million    vs	  558    million</p>
<p> Current	    455    million    vs	  572    million</p>
<p> Net		  202    million    vs	  261    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.71 yen	  vs	    9.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  26 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Pipe Manufactruring Co Ltd is a producer of conduit tubes and automotive structural tubes and is affiliated to Sumitomo Metal Industries Ltd.</p>
